## Customer pool + joint LOV (7pj implementation)

**Verify lens:** `21-a-plus-five-year-verify.mdc` (general A+ / 5-year — any feature).

### Do / don’t

| Do | Don’t |
|----|-------|
| INS `loadCustomersCached` | `joint-service` for 7pj |
| `DirectBookJoint*` BUR slice | Fat shared `JointItem` / `JointDetail` |
| `makeCustomerPoolLoad` + `customerPool` computed | Per-row full list fetch |
| `CUSTOMER_SCROLL` on large LOV | Plain dropdown 1000+ options |
| `customerOpt` from `tab1-check.js` | Ad-hoc option mapping |

### Files

```
burglary/joint-pool.js   # isPoolWarm, shouldSharePoolLoad, peekJointCustomers
burglary/joint.js        # makeCustomerPoolLoad, openJointCustomers
Components/Burglary/DirectBookJointDetail.vue
Components/Burglary/DirectBookJointItem.vue
```

### Wiring

Parent: `makeCustomerPoolLoad(state)` → `customerPool` with `load` returning `options[]`.

Row: `fillCustomers()` → `openJointCustomers(type, pool)` on `@show` and edit hydrate.

Multi-type: `shouldSharePoolLoad` before `pool.load`.

Errors: `joint_account_details.{i}.{field}` (7pj). Legacy: `joint_details.*`.

### Verify

```bash
node scripts/verify-joint-pool.mjs
npm run build
```

Manual: one INS GET per type; no `joint-service` on 7pj joint. Legacy PubLiab still `joint-service`.
